SOLUTION 1 Pure water 100C pH 3
    temp 100
    pH 3 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica 0 10
    Kaolinite 0 10
    Dolomite 0 10
    Epsomite 0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a) 0 10
    Halite 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings sc
10 PUNCH SC